        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 8 This allows the EVCC to verify the integrity of the sales tariff by performing unique SECC verification. SECC/SA implementation is supposed to use the EVCC contract certificate chain which was transmitted in the element ContractCertificateChain of the message AuthorizationReq to identify the private key which can be used for signing the PriceSchedule. This requirement could be fulfilled by cooperation between SECC and SA including online communication; or the signed PriceSchedule can be cached.",
