        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-907] In case of PnC, the EVCC, after receiving the PriceSchedule, should verify the signature using the same sub-CA certificate that was used to issue the contract certificate that the EVCC previously used during authorization. If this verification fails, the EVCC may treat the PriceSchedule as invalid. See [V2G20-1569].",
